    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with up to 5 other friends to escape a slowly flooding facility by pressing buttons, flipping switches, toggling generators, turning valves and fixing powerboxes.<br> <br>Flood Descendance is a unique spin on the delverlike genre, where instead of monsters, there's floods. Work together with up to 5 other players into a slowly flooding facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to work together to trigger buttons, fix powerboxes and solve puzzles to open doors and get to the exit elevator, before the flood drowns you. <br> <br>Swim your way through submerged parts of the map, but be quick! Your oxygen won't last forever. <br>  <br>(Quickly) parkour your way through tower sections! Don't look back; and keep moving! The flood won't wait for you. <br><br>Survived this round? Head down to the shop and purchase team-wide upgrades! You'll need it, as the facility gets harder to escape from here.  <br><br>Descend down deeper into the facility. Floors get progressively harder the deeper you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far will you descend?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with up to 5 other friends to escape a slowly flooding facility by pressing buttons, flipping switches, toggling generators, turning valves and fixing powerboxes.<br> <br>Flood Descendance is a unique spin on the delverlike genre, where instead of monsters, there's floods. Work together with up to 5 other players into a slowly flooding facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to work together to trigger buttons, fix powerboxes and solve puzzles to open doors and get to the exit elevator, before the flood drowns you. <br> <br>Swim your way through submerged parts of the map, but be quick! Your oxygen won't last forever. <br>  <br>(Quickly) parkour your way through tower sections! Don't look back; and keep moving! The flood won't wait for you. <br><br>Survived this round? Head down to the shop and purchase team-wide upgrades! You'll need it, as the facility gets harder to escape from here.  <br><br>Descend down deeper into the facility. Floors get progressively harder the deeper you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far will you descend?</p>",
